{"availability":"available","full":"Appz4Fun/NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi","name":"NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi","description":"Kodi 21 addon — stream Usenet via NZBHydra2 + nzbdav WebDAV. TMDBHelper player integration, PTT filtering, auto-updates via Kodi repository.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":13,"forks":6,"created":"2026-04-05T07:27:59Z","updated":"2026-10-07T13:08:19Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://appz4fun.github.io/NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi/","topics":["coreelec","dolby-vision","ffmpeg","kodi","kodi-addon","kodi-plugin","nzb","nzbdav","nzbhydra","prowlarr","python","streaming","tmdbhelper","usenet","webdav"],"demo":"https://appz4fun.github.io/NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:45.116Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:45.116Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:45.116Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.397Z","stars":13,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:45.116Z","stars":13,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Current released packages (Stable 1.2.3 and Beta 2.0.0-beta.2) use the Kodi menu name NZB-DAV. In those builds, choose that name wherever these instructions show NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi. Renamed source builds use the new name.","A Kodi 21 (Omega) player/resolver add-on that streams Usenet media through TMDBHelper. You browse a movie or TV episode in TMDBHelper, NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi searches your indexers, you pick a release, and NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi streams it through nzbdav or InfiniDysk, with a progress bar, seeking, and automatic recovery when a source goes bad. No manual NZB handling required. An optional download-first NZBGet backend is also available.","This add-on provides software, not content. You bring your own indexers (NZBHydra2, Prowlarr, or direct Newznab), your own nzbdav, InfiniDysk, or NZBGet server, and your own Usenet provider."],"features":["Multi-provider search across NZBHydra2, Prowlarr, and direct Newznab","indexers, merged and de-duplicated. Optional TVDB-aware TV search resolves a show's id for more accurate episode results.","Quality filtering and ranking by resolution, HDR, audio, codec, language,","release group, size, and keywords. Default-enabled Other / Unknown options prevent unrecognized formats from disappearing. Relevance ranks resolution first, then HDR, Hybrid REMUX / REMUX, and three editable TRaSH remux…","Exact season-pack playback and reuse: completed multi-episode downloads"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Appz4Fun/NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5a8f52e14ebf5bc58d93730accb943cb6b490db0feab051215bd54b172700c8d","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.562Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.562Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Current released packages (Stable 1.2.3 and Beta 2.0.0-beta.2) use the Kodi menu name NZB-DAV. In those builds, choose that name wherever these instructions show NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi. Renamed source builds use the new name.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Appz4Fun/NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5a8f52e14ebf5bc58d93730accb943cb6b490db0feab051215bd54b172700c8d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Appz4Fun/NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.564Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T01:05:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Appz4Fun/NeNeTeePee-Stream-Kodi/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.566Z","hash":"5a8f52e14ebf5bc58d93730accb943cb6b490db0feab051215bd54b172700c8d","originalBytes":14016,"storedBytes":14016,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["kodi","neneteepee-stream-kodi","repository","add-on","install","just","tmdbhelper","zip","beta","nzbdav","player","release","docs","nzbget","proxy","search","see","settings","test","add-ons","backend","optional","playback","appz4fun","channel","inde